+# Eval sidecars
+
+An eval may keep a name.sidecar.json beside name.bend. The sidecar stores
+diagnostics, graph roots, attempted proof moves, residual distinctions,
+evidence, the next discriminator and a reopen trigger. It never replaces the
+.bend file and never upgrades UNRESOLVED residue into a decision.
diff --git a/evals/_template.sidecar.json b/evals/_template.sidecar.json
new file mode 100644
